UniMol-Lite
===========

UniMol-Lite is a lightweight, independent implementation of Uni-Mol for SMILES
featurization, model inference and masked-atom pretraining.

Authors
-------
Lvjun Guo (Ficere) <gljx898989@163.com>
David Niteas <david.ql.d@foxmail.com>

What's shipped
--------------
This repository contains code, configuration and documentation only. It does not
include official Uni-Mol pretrained weights, training data or LMDB files.

UniMol-Lite is not the official Uni-Mol release and is not maintained or
endorsed by the Uni-Mol authors. The official implementation and weights are
available at https://github.com/deepmodeling/Uni-Mol.

Citation
--------
If you use this project, cite the Uni-Mol paper. The BibTeX entry is in
README.md, and the full notices are in docs/en/09-references.md and
